Which is, which I think is really cool. Would you like to have a big garden in the future?&nbsp;

00:08:39.840 --> 00:08:48.693
I think I would like to have a big garden in the&nbsp;future. Um, "there's something really nice about" being&nbsp;around nature and around plants.&nbsp;

00:08:48.693 --> 00:08:57.892
And again that&nbsp;aspect of the veggie garden is something that I&nbsp;really like, and I would like to incorporate that&nbsp;into my home when I'm older and in the future.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:58.236 --> 00:09:03.686
Another important aspect of your pronunciation&nbsp;score is that you use intonation correctly.

00:09:03.686 --> 00:09:07.438
