and then she says some more, and then at the end, when she's&nbsp;finished, she goes down.

00:09:27.522 --> 00:09:33.995
If you pay attention to that you'll notice how she's communicating with&nbsp;her intonation as well as with her vocabulary.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:35.100 --> 00:09:41.978
Part two in the next part of the test I'm&nbsp;going to give you a topic, and I would like&nbsp;you to speak on this for one to two minutes.

00:09:41.978 --> 00:09:48.149
You will have one minute to think about what&nbsp;you want to say, and I will give you a pen and&nbsp;some paper to make notes if you want.

