Remember you have one&nbsp;to two minutes for this, so don't worry if&nbsp;I stop you.

00:10:30.536 --> 00:10:39.293
I'll tell you when the time is up. Can you start speaking now please? Okay, so the&nbsp;first phone that I owned was when I was in year six. 

