00:11:21.014 --> 00:11:30.060
These "groovy cutting-edge iPhones" with touchscreens. Um, and I had my little cute retro Nokia.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:30.324 --> 00:11:37.595
Um, but I look back at it, and I almost want to have&nbsp;a Nokia here again now. I kind of miss my phone.&nbsp;

00:11:37.911 --> 00:11:43.361
Um, because I think it was just really nice to&nbsp;be able to focus just on contacting friends,

00:11:43.361 --> 00:11:47.349
