00:13:03.260 --> 00:13:11.769
So if it's difficult for&nbsp;a native English speaker in their own language, of&nbsp;course, it's going to be challenging for you&nbsp;as well in a second language.

00:13:11.769 --> 00:13:15.558
So do lots of preparation for IELTS speaking part two.

00:13:15.558 --> 00:13:21.408
