00:13:32.896 --> 00:13:37.662
Now part three. I wanna stay on the topic of communication.

00:13:38.382 --> 00:13:43.134
Has our ability to communicate with each other improved over the last fifty years. 

00:13:44.715 --> 00:13:51.716
I think this is an&nbsp;interesting question because I think that obviously, it has with the increase&nbsp;of technology.

00:13:51.716 --> 00:14:00.000
So what I was saying before about how we can, you know, contact people, mobile&nbsp;phones, we can send messages, we can send photos.&nbsp;

00:14:00.307 --> 00:14:07.289
Um, things like FaceTime and video chat make&nbsp;it really accessible to contact people when&nbsp;you're not physically with them.

