00:16:03.091 --> 00:16:12.180
Julia&nbsp;gives a nice amount of development. Enough that the&nbsp;answer is strongly supported and then she finishes&nbsp;waits for the next question and starts again.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:13.080 --> 00:16:16.860
And why is it important to understand&nbsp;how different cultures communicate&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:17.640 --> 00:16:29.379
I think it's really important because as&nbsp;we've seen through the increasive technology communication within a single culture can&nbsp;change so much over a period of time.&nbsp;

00:16:29.379 --> 00:16:36.300
So... and so, seeing how different cultures&nbsp;vary in terms of communication style,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:37.020 --> 00:16:51.817
It just shows you that it's really, really necessary to appreciate and understand how those&nbsp;variations are sort of crucial to understanding&nbsp;the cultures, of course, but then also understanding&nbsp;communication itself.&nbsp;

00:16:51.817 --> 00:16:57.019
Because there is such a&nbsp;vast variety and there is no right or wrong way.

00:16:57.660 --> 00:17:05.376
Thank you. That is the end of this practice IELTS&nbsp;
speaking test. Thank you. So, Julia, how is that&nbsp;for you. &nbsp;

